legend bottom
  <b>bold bright letter</b> — the key itself, drawn inside the word it triggers
  <back:#7aa2f7><color:#000000> filled button </color></back> — the answer Enter gives; ↵ sits on it
  <back:#282d42> dark badge </back> — a value, a step count, an unselected button
